- !<Text/c5e72743-a3e6-4f8c-46ee-6983cc0ee2bf>
  PrefabRemaps:
    []
  Name: Text
  Enabled: true
  RenderOrder: 11
  StretchMode: Stretch
  VerticalAlignment: Center
  HorizontalAlignment: Left
  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    This project tests the Supabase Client package, the Snap Cloud (Supabase) client for Specs Lenses. It has no 3D content: each test prints PASS / FAIL lines to the Logger.
    
    Client Tests signs in with Snapchat, calls edge functions, reads and writes a table and uploads / downloads Storage files. Realtime Test joins a broadcast channel and sends a message. Both need a Snap Cloud project and run fully only on a paired Specs device.
